.TH sam-jail-self-update 1 2026-11-16 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-self\-update \- Update SAM itself, when it runs from its AppImage ($APPIMAGE)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail self\-update\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update SAM itself, when it runs from its AppImage ($APPIMAGE)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Only check whether a newer SAM is published
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
